{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a <strong>ANARIA</strong> \u2013 <i>You wake up. But sleep was never part of it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped inside a house that bends like a fractured mind. Walls shift. Rooms question your sanity. And somewhere, just out of reach \u2014 that voice. Always there. Mocking you. Leading you. Slowly unmaking you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know where you are.<br>But a part of you remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANARIA</strong> is a psychological horror game designed to unravel you from the inside. You won\u2019t find answers spelled out \u2014 only fragments, broken memories, and places that shouldn\u2019t exist. All haunted by a presence that feels too close. Too familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no cutscenes. No tutorials. No safety nets.<br>Only you, the creaking silence, and whatever waits beyond the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>Candles are your only light.</strong> Each room hides a few \u2014 and their flicker is all that keeps the dark from breathing.<br>But the red ones? They're different. If you find a red candle, stop. Something matters there. It\u2019s never just for show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa Leave doors open behind you, and the paranoia starts to whisper.<br>The longer they stay open, the more certain you\u2019ll be: something is following you. You\u2019ll feel it. Cold. Silent. Watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Made entirely by one developer over years of work, <strong>ANARIA</strong> is raw, imperfect, and deeply personal. It doesn\u2019t aim to impress \u2014 it aims to disturb. And it delivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 This isn\u2019t just a horror game.<br>It\u2019s a spiral.<br>And once you\u2019re in... there\u2019s no clean way out.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/97562d1a1619178c53fb75730dab6663df45eac3.jpg"},{"name":"CHAPTER 1 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/db8e65b13384e70520ceca9d1460cb53aee3f975.jpg"},{"name":"Listen to the music","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/5aa1e81f7f8da8f77ecdb826610273e178340591.jpg"},{"name":"Who was it!?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/8b6cccc40c27f2dc5774fe99ea17275b36c343c9.jpg"},{"name":"I like you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/8233a19ac99e8dd36a8f26bdb1eaba3c7189f954.jpg"},{"name":"WHY?!!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/8233a19ac99e8dd36a8f26bdb1eaba3c7189f954.jpg"},{"name":"Do You see me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/95afb31d3aa3d8a5ff551aea703cf9e3f8d22c91.jpg"},{"name":"What is this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/d147b1b26704f29e3eabda83ac2c0806b3d3fe39.jpg"},{"name":"My Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/f6be1ae5345bc1c2dc3729a3a3fd8ed200c0e936.jpg"},{"name":"Do you like?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757530/8d1d644a3784e501e5cfca1abf7c790cd72ab52c.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757530?t=1758365681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757530?t=1758365681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757530/35efd1703869d96eb0be54301e2588ac93b9d9d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758365681","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757530/35efd1703869d96eb0be54301e2588ac93b9d9d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758365681","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains blood effects and intense psychological horror elements, including scary sounds and a disturbing atmosphere. There are brief scenes with animated blood splatter, but no graphic gore or explicit violence. No sexual, drug-related, or offensive language content is present.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<h1>ANARIA</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757530/extras/4f9700347863ca32fac688a32101a3c9.avif?t=1758365681\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757530/extras_big/4f9700347863ca32fac688a32101a3c9.avif?t=1758365681 width=800 height=338 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2a <strong>ANARIA</strong> \u2013 <i>You wake up. But sleep was never part of it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped inside a house that bends like a fractured mind. Walls shift. Rooms question your sanity. And somewhere, just out of reach \u2014 that voice. Always there. Mocking you. Leading you. Slowly unmaking you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t know where you are.<br>But a part of you remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANARIA</strong> is a psychological horror game designed to unravel you from the inside. You won\u2019t find answers spelled out \u2014 only fragments, broken memories, and places that shouldn\u2019t exist. All haunted by a presence that feels too close. Too familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no cutscenes. No tutorials. No safety nets.<br>Only you, the creaking silence, and whatever waits beyond the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f <strong>Candles are your only light.</strong> Each room hides a few \u2014 and their flicker is all that keeps the dark from breathing.<br>But the red ones? They're different. If you find a red candle, stop. Something matters there. It\u2019s never just for show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa Leave doors open behind you, and the paranoia starts to whisper.<br>The longer they stay open, the more certain you\u2019ll be: something is following you. You\u2019ll feel it. Cold. Silent. Watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Made entirely by one developer over years of work, <strong>ANARIA</strong> is raw, imperfect, and deeply personal. It doesn\u2019t aim to impress \u2014 it aims to disturb. And it delivers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 This isn\u2019t just a horror game.<br>It\u2019s a spiral.<br>And once you\u2019re in... there\u2019s no clean way out.</p>","developers":["VOIDEMBER"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757530/b395d6da8cdd1dd0237c9b2f5c0ea9a75e08e814/header.jpg?t=1758365681","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 [Void Ember]. All rights reserved.<br>This game uses licensed assets from the Unity Asset Store and royalty-free music under attribution licenses.<br>Full credits available in-game.<br>","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/37